Z||000010||TRiAD||12-26-2001||07:11 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>...are ya to lazy to turn a key?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, you still must turn the key. <P>You turn the key to "run", then push the button. <P>Personally, I like them, but for another reason. I've had 2 cars that BROKE the key OFF in the ignition! With this (and keyless entry), you're never putting pressure on those brass keys. <P><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://centralillinoisimports.org/uploads/files/SigRear4.gif">        <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B><BR>Photoshop rendition of planned modifications<BR>AIM ~ Michael Blue 72</I></FONT>||||reg||1
